{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"95056","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/95056","key":"MC-183743","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"13/May/20 4:57 AM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<p>I settled a small village of 7 villagers (1 Farmer, 1 Cleric, 5 Librarians) at my base, and after AFKing for a while in a farm nearby there are loads of golems both inside and outside of the main building (but mostly outside, there's not a whole lot of room for them to spawn inside). I've been culling their population pretty regularly as a source of iron so I didn't think much about their spawn rate, but this made me think that there might be something off.</p>\n\n<p>The area around is well lit and hemmed in by berries and fencing, so I don't think they're spawning from the villagers panicking due to hostile mobs.</p>\n\n<p>E: Forgot to mention that all seven of the villagers have been zombified and subsequently cured. Also, there are five unemployed villagers in a spawning room nearby (the small netherraack building) that also seem to be spawning some of their own golems. The unemployed villagers have not been zombified/cured.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"17/Jun/20 2:30 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/124374","id":"124374","filename":"2020-05-09_10.59.39.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.u