nk they're spawning from the villagers panicking due to hostile mobs."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"E: Forgot to mention that all seven of the villagers have been zombified and subsequently cured. Also, there are five unemployed villagers in a spawning room nearby (the small netherraack building) that also seem to be spawning some of their own golems. The unemployed villagers have not been zombified/cured."}]}]},"customfield_10054":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/customFieldOption/10023","value":"Confirmed","id":"10023"},"fixVersions":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/version/10371","id":"10371","name":"20w27a","archived":true,"released":true,"releaseDate":"2020-07-01"}],"customfield_10055":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/customFieldOption/10066","value":"Mob spawning","id":"10066"}],"resolution":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/resolution/10004","id":"10004","description":"A fix for this issue is checked into the tree and tested.","name":"Fixed"},"customfield_10047":"2020-06-17T14:30:00.000-0700","customfield_10048":null,"labels":["mojang_internal_1"],"customfield_10049":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/customFieldOption/10079","value":"Normal","id":"10079"},"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/124374","id":"124374","filename":"2020-05-09_10.59.39.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","32x32":"https://secure